Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.31,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)\blur5}私は煌めく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:26.31,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur5}見上げてごらん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.48,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\an3\pos(1840,1020)\blur5}見上げてごらん
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:31.19,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\an3\pos(1840,1020)\blur5}涙が溢れて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:31.53,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(80,1020)\clip(m 438 1080 b 439 1068 441 1049 442 1039 443 1029 446 1008 447 998 448 995 449 987 450 984 451 977 454 963 455 956 456 949 458 936 460 930 460 925 462 917 463 912 463 909 464 900 465 900 371 900 183 900 0 900 0 944 0 1033 0 1080)\blur5}初めて選んだ言葉があるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:36.91,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(80,1020)\blur5}初めて選んだ言葉があるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:42.66,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(873,873,\alpha&H00&\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&)\t(4752,4917,\c&H000000&\1a&HAA&)\blur5}震えることも美しく見えるの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.46,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\blur5}だから大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:48.38,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,0)\blur5\t(790,790,\alpha&HFF&)}醜さも私
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.38,0:01:49.79,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\blur5}教えて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:54.01,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(504,240)\blur5}あなたは愛を知らされて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:59.68,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}抱きしめきれない闇の大きさに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:05.06,OP - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,625)\blur5}少し笑って　どこまで進むの？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:12.11,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,877)\an1\pos(980,1071)\fs55\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\blur5}灯火のような幸せの陽を追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:12.11,OP - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,877)\an2\pos(960,1075)\fs67\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&\blur5}|
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.39,0:20:55.32,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5}我能就像现在这样吗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.57,0:20:57.01,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}好想被爱
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.01,0:21:03.42,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}哪怕抛下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.89,0:21:07.11,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}从未和他人拼凑在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.92,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}诉说着话语  却无法沟通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.89,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}无法融入这世界的「理所当然」
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.89,0:21:15.17,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}也找不到归处
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.38,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.5}没有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}总是顾及别人的视线
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.82,0:21:26.31,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}在自己身上涂改
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.31,0:21:29.44,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}写下我的名字  刻在心里
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.44,0:21:33.48,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}将那个不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.64,0:21:39.74,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}留在过去
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.28,0:21:46.09,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.09,0:21:48.41,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.41,0:21:51.55,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs55}离开这逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.55,0:21:57.51,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5\fs55}渴求着爱而颤抖着的心
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.63,0:22:01.63,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5\fs55}将因照耀着明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.33,0:22:04.68,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}而熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.60,0:22:15.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}我也一定会是某个人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.39,0:20:55.32,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.57,0:20:57.01,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.01,0:21:03.42,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.89,0:21:07.11,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.92,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.92,0:21:12.89,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.89,0:21:15.17,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.38,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.93,0:21:23.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.82,0:21:26.31,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.31,0:21:29.44,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.44,0:21:33.48,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.64,0:21:39.74,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.28,0:21:46.09,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.09,0:21:48.41,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.41,0:21:51.55,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.55,0:21:57.51,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.63,0:22:01.63,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.5\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.33,0:22:04.68,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.5}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.60,0:22:15.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.5}きっと誰かの光だから
